		class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-14};};
		title="Interaction Examples Showcase: all ten field-equipment procedures (wirecut, minesweeper, keypad, lockpick, circuit, repair, radiotune, pressure, sequence, commandinput) side by side, each set up with a single Waldo_fnc_MiniGameInteractionSetup call and cycling through easy/standard/hard/expert difficulty so every profile is represented. Each object is independent - copy one line onto your own object to reuse a single procedure. Wiki: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Waldos-Mini-Games";
